  instructions: 'What is gold and orange like a forest, but smells like liquor? An
    almost familiar drink with an almost familiar name. The nickname of a forgetful
    detective who enjoys his booze a little too much. The worst thing about alcohol
    is that it makes you do things you wouldn''t normally do. The second worst thing
    is that it makes you not remember doing them. '
